        {
          "book": "REV",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "Leave out the court which is outside of the temple, and don’t measure it, for it has been given to the nations. They will tread the holy city under foot for forty-two months.",
      "ko": "성전 밖 마당은 척량하지 말고 그냥 두라 이것을 이방인에게 주었은즉 저희가 거룩한 성을 마흔 두달 동안 짓밟으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "adb404acf06bc398b52596e1a1cfa0ffdc134db8243296e4008aeeaa4724bb0b",
      "translation_text_hash": "792d699de8e80a9b1b623d4520505393218d6e9a2693b8295db18b74720959cf",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
