      ],
      "en": "I will give power to my two witnesses, and they will prophesy one thousand two hundred sixty days, clothed in sackcloth.”",
      "ko": "내가 나의 두 증인에게 권세를 주리니 저희가 굵은 베옷을 입고 일천 이백 육십 일을 예언하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "9defd01a4bb2ab5e97d14bf10c9226c7f461e7c94c46ba57f1acfd703b364e1c",
      "translation_text_hash": "53d3a3cfc8e4bf69f26f8c6b5f06a789abe336ccac2e51ec19e29b40419a1a62",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
