      "en": "These are the two olive trees and the two lamp stands, standing before the Lord of the earth.",
      "ko": "이는 이 땅의 주 앞에 섰는 두 감람나무와 두 촛대니",
      "source_text_hash": "28996890ca8700aae2f8786305161383da14eae9e45c0829256b39657945bb4a",
      "translation_text_hash": "37ffe9de6bde68b2e21e65d750f0eeb033aa18725ba60aa0f72d1e00e60da760",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
