        "verse": 8
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "REV",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "Their dead bodies will be in the street of the great city, which spiritually is called Sodom and Egypt, where also their Lord was crucified.",
      "ko": "저희 시체가 큰 성길에 있으리니 그 성은 영적으로 하면 소돔이라고도 하고 애굽이라고도 하니 곧 저희 주께서 십자가에 못 박히신 곳이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "68c310efa57effbc63a2a3bb3eec85d1ce1e7161e501664a709c2b4d68e0f371",
      "translation_text_hash": "def3241c71bc6d7aebedd1b68e902584ab7da658501d9756533ac640575e4dbe",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
