      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "REV",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "From among the peoples, tribes, languages, and nations, people will look at their dead bodies for three and a half days, and will not allow their dead bodies to be laid in a tomb.",
      "ko": "백성들과 족속과 방언과 나라 중에서 사람들이 그 시체를 사흘 반 동안을 목도하며 무덤에 장사하지 못하게 하리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "fb3fc20fd54bc6fd9bec6612aa3231539b268e6a9cd95f35b0bb1b313710b861",
      "translation_text_hash": "ee9b657fa5c1c83c78e437f5d0f4b0216af730b62227fd241b706ee3a9d7184f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
