      "en": "The nations were angry, and your wrath came, as did the time for the dead to be judged, and to give your bondservants the prophets, their reward, as well as to the saints and those who fear your name, to the small and the great, and to destroy those who destroy the earth.”",
      "ko": "이방들이 분노하매 주의 진노가 임하여 죽은 자를 심판하시며 종 선지자들과 성도들과 또 무론대소하고 주의 이름을 경외하는 자들에게 상 주시며 또 땅을 망하게 하는 자들을 멸망시키실 때로소이다 하더라",
      "source_text_hash": "47c642f624432a0914c351af495769539b3734a57d31a6de903a5ded5c6c7623",
      "translation_text_hash": "8ec05ff41bf33423a65eda2eb3ef306dd78a6c1a543d17e028f5878d86100ec5",
